WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.744
Watch and read: Ama asks: Where in a home is the place where food is prepared?

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.710
The answer is: kitchen. Name places found at home.

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:15.014
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama describes the kitchen. Which sentence stays on topic?

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:20.283
The answer is: The kitchen is a place in our home.. Describe what you can see or do

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:20.773
at home.
